| P1 | An archive destination write error could emit an unhandled stream error during FFmpeg provisioning. | A pipeline owns download/output failure and rejects normally. The media-reliability disk-error fixture verifies it. [src/main/hls/ffmpeg.ts](<C:/Users/Nihil/Desktop/Github Repos/Draco/src/main/hls/ffmpeg.ts>). |
| P2 | MPD `-map 0` saved every resolution/audio representation for a Best available download. | FFmpeg chooses one best video/audio stream. An actual multi-rendition fixture checks one highest-resolution video track. [src/main/dash/runner.ts](<C:/Users/Nihil/Desktop/Github Repos/Draco/src/main/dash/runner.ts>). |
